## Pipeline truth

`git commit` ≠ merged ≠ deployed ≠ production verified. **MERGED ≠ LIVE.** A green CI check or a merge is not LIVE. Record deploy SHA and health before claiming production.

Website PR **#88** (“Keep the production Actions runner online…”) **closed without merge**. Production deploy reliability is still unresolved. Do not report website production as healthy from a merge or green CI alone.

## Connector done ≠ authenticated

A connector is **not** done when it merely authenticates. It needs scoped R/W, external IDs, health/freshness, idempotent retries, divergence detection, verified reconciliation, failure reporting, and audit.

